config RUST_TASK_WORK
	bool "Rust task-work source proposal (not admitted)"
	depends on RUST && BROKEN
	default n
	help
	  Inactive continuation of the existing task-work Rust implementation.
	  Native ABI/CFI, diagnostic attribution, instrumentation, concurrency
	  and original-test qualification remain open. Keep this disabled.
